{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24273","headline":"闲园独赏 · 白居易","name":"闲园独赏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"午後郊园静，晴来景物新。\n雨添山气色，风借水精神。\n永日若爲度，独游何所亲。\n仙禽狎君子，芳树倚佳人。\n蚁鬬王争肉，蜗移舍逐身。\n蝶双知伉俪，蜂分见君臣。\n蠢蠕形虽小，逍遥性即均。\n不知鹏与鷃，相去几微尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}